.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt MB 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mb
.Nd store, search, and cite versioned metaBrain documents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl Fl store Ar store
.Op Fl Fl server Ar endpoint | Fl Fl no-server
.Ar command
.Op Ar arguments ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
operates on a local metaBrain store directly or through the
.Nm mbd
daemon.
Read the selected store's own agent manual with
.Cm mb get /AGENTS.md .
Start with a scoped search.
Use
.Fl Fl view Cm refs
to choose documents or
.Fl Fl view Cm evidence
to find verbatim passages.
Use
.Cm mb get Fl Fl ref
to verify the passage in its retained revision before citing it.
Use
.Cm mb links
to inspect Markdown citations to current documents.
A newly initialized store includes this document by default.
Run
.Cm mb ensure-guide
to install the bundled guide in an existing store when it is missing.
An existing guide retains its contents and version.
.Pp
Run
.Cm mb man
for the command list or
.Cm mb man search
for a command's current flags.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "METABRAIN_STORE"
.It Ev METABRAIN_STORE
Store location when no explicit
.Fl Fl store
is supplied.
.El
.Sh CITATION AUDIT
.Cm mb lint
audits current Markdown links across the selected store.
An optional virtual path scopes the audit to that document and its descendants.
Link resolution still uses the whole store.
The report includes missing or ambiguous targets and heading or block anchors.
Use
.Fl Fl orphans
to check for Markdown notes with no indexed backlink from another document.
Use
.Fl Fl strict
to exit with status 3 after printing any selected findings.
The default format is JSON.
Use
.Fl Fl format Cm text
for a readable summary or
.Fl Fl format Cm jsonl
for one finding per line.
.Sh PROJECT OPERATIONS
.Cm mb operation inspect Ar operation.json
prints a JSON preview containing the project, full document replacements, target identities and versions, and a digest.
Review the preview, then pass that file to
.Cm mb operation apply Ar preview.json .
The operation commits all proposed notes in one batch.
On a conflict, inspect the changed notes and generate a new preview.
After a lost response, submit the original preview again to retrieve its receipt.
.Sh CLAIMS
Project inspection reports the document IDs it will assign to new paths.
Use those IDs in versioned evidence references on the decision's claims, then inspect and apply the completed operation.
Each claim has a stable UUID within its note, a state, and supporting or contradicting evidence.
The JSON form of
.Cm mb get
includes stored claims and source assessments.
Run
.Cm mb lint Ar project Fl Fl format Cm text
to report changed, unavailable, or insufficient evidence.
.Sh ORIGINAL FILES
.Cm mb source stage Ar file Fl Fl origin Ar origin
reads one local file and prints capture JSON.
Use
.Fl Fl media-type Ar type
to record its MIME type and
.Fl Fl extraction Ar method
to record how the note body was derived.
Set the source document's
.Cm sourceCapture
field to this JSON in a project operation.
.Cm mb source export Ar path Fl Fl output Ar file
writes the verified original to a local file.
Use
.Fl Fl id Ar id
in place of a path after a move, and
.Fl Fl version Ar sequence
to select a retained revision.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ".metabrain/store.leveldb"
.It Pa /AGENTS.md
Virtual document inside the selected store.
Read it with
.Cm mb get /AGENTS.md .
.It Pa .metabrain/store.leveldb
Default store discovered in the working directory or its ancestors.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
mb search --tag storage --view refs --limit 5
mb search "nightly backups" --view evidence --max-tokens 512
mb get --ref "$ref" --context section --max-tokens 1024
mb links /decisions/backups.md
mb links /policies/Retention.md --incoming --block keep-last
mb lint /decisions --strict
mb get /policies/Retention.md --block keep-last
.Ed
